>> detail-oriented blather might be relevant in scientific discussions, it is
>> not so in everyday conversation. Apologies for the rudeness of the last
>> statement, I'm at a loss for a way to say that more politely at the moment.
>>
>> On Thu, Aug 18, 2011 at 5:47 AM, tijlan <jbotijlan@gmail.com> wrote:
>>
>>> This response is going to be extensive. I do this because writing down
>>> my thoughts in detail helps me improve my understanding of the matter.
>>>
>>>
>>> On 16 August 2011 15:00, Jonathan Jones <eyeonus@gmail.com> wrote:
